<title>CHINA: Wai Kee yearly net jumps sharply.</title>
<headline>Wai Kee yearly net jumps sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   48.69	 vs 16.82</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    7.0	   vs 5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  236.95 gain vs 71.93 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    322.13	vs 100.33</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,327.86    vs 820.05</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wai Kee Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 11-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 22</p>
<p>NOTE - Wai Kee is the civil engineering group.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$246.71 million on dilution of interest in a subsidiary and loss of HK$9.76 million on disposal of an associated company.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 10 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of three cents) vs seven cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
